# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# SyncBoard Monorepo Environment Configuration
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# SyncBoard uses isolated environment configuration per workspace package:
#
#   • Backend API & WebSocket: backend/.env   (template: backend/.env.example)
#   • Frontend Web App (SPA):  frontend/.env  (template: frontend/.env.example)
#
# For local development, copy each example into its respective folder:
#   cp backend/.env.example backend/.env
#   cp frontend/.env.example frontend/.env
#
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Split Production Hosting Configuration (Vercel Frontend + Render Backend)
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# 1. Render (Backend Service)
#    Configure these environment variables in your Render Dashboard:
#
#    NODE_ENV=production
#    PORT=5000                                 # Or Render's auto-assigned $PORT
#    TRUST_PROXY=1                             # Required: inspects real client IP via X-Forwarded-For
#    MONGODB_URI=mongodb+srv://...             # MongoDB Atlas connection URI
#    JWT_ACCESS_SECRET=<32+ char secret>       # openssl rand -base64 48
#    CORS_ORIGIN=https://<your-app>.vercel.app # Vercel production domain (no trailing slash)
#    APP_URL=https://<your-app>.vercel.app     # Web app URL used in email links
#    COOKIE_SAMESITE=none                      # Required: allows cross-site refresh cookie
#    COOKIE_SECURE=true                        # Required when SameSite=none
#    # COOKIE_DOMAIN                           # Leave UNSET for cross-site split hosting
#
# 2. Vercel (Frontend Project)
#    Configure these environment variables in your Vercel Dashboard:
#    (Vite inlines VITE_* variables into client JS bundles during build)
#
#    VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://<your-backend>.onrender.com/api
#    VITE_SOCKET_URL=https://<your-backend>.onrender.com
#    VITE_APP_NAME=SyncBoard
#    VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=<optional-google-client-id>
#
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
